title: Kamla_Day7
tags:
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite HutInterior>>

In the quiet moments before sleep, Raju chooses to spend time talking with his mother.

Sensing that tonight might be important.

For something more significant than daily conversation.

The peaceful intimacy of their modest home creates a sacred space for conversation.

As evening settles around Raju and Kamla.

The day's activities giving way to the deeper reflections.

That often emerge in quiet moments between mother and son.

The accumulated experiences of the past week have built toward this moment.

Of connection and understanding.

With both sensing that tonight's conversation will formalize commitments and promises.

That have been growing through daily demonstrations of character and faith.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: Beta, before you sleep tonight, I want to tell you something very important.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: Something I've been thinking about for days now.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: What is it, Ma?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: You sound very serious.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: For six days, I've been watching you, testing you.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: Learning about the kind of person you're becoming.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: I understand that cricket isn't just a game for you.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: It's a calling, something that brings out your best qualities.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Ma, what are you saying?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: I'm saying that I promise you.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: Whatever happens with your father's concerns.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: Whatever doubts other people might have.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: Whatever challenges come in the future.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: I will always support your cricket dreams.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Serious">>
Kamla: Always, beta. Completely and unconditionally.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: I've watched you for six days, and your dream isn't impossible.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: And my support isn't blind.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: You've earned this promise through your character.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Ma, you're the most wonderful mother in the world.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I can't believe you believe in me this much.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: And you're going to be an incredible cricketer, Raju.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: Not just because of your natural talent.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: But because of who you are as a person.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: I feel it in my heart - your success is coming.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I promise I won't let you down, Ma.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I'll make our whole family proud.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Not just through cricket, but through everything I do.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: Beta, you already have made me proud.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: Every morning when you chose to help before cricket.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: Every moment when you showed that dreams and responsibility can work together.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Kamla" "Smiling">>
Kamla: You've already given me more pride than any trophy could.

<<HideAllCharacters>>

As Raju settles into sleep carrying his mother's unconditional promise, he understands the gift he has received.

Something more precious than any material advantage.

The absolute faith of someone who knows his character intimately.

And believes in his potential to achieve greatness.

While remaining true to his values.

Kamla's commitment represents not just support for his athletic goals.

But validation of his worth as a person.

Capable of transforming dreams into reality through dedication and integrity.

